4,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a logical way to allocate these spaces. I suggest we look into actual usage patterns and the physical layout to avoid chaos.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. However, we must also consider the financial aspect. We need to know the actual costs and payments involved in bike parking.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,Fairness is key. I am concerned that some residents feel the allocation has been biased toward certain units in the past.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not get too emotional. We need data on how people actually behave and how previous disputes were handled to avoid a social disaster.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm excited to help! But who's going to do the actual work once we decide? I want to know how much effort the paperwork takes!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, financial data is useful, but it won't solve the physical congestion. We need to see how the bikes are actually being parked.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,Physical layout is a secondary concern if the funding for maintenance is unclear. We need to see the ledger and the collection files.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I believe the sticker register and the minutes from the last five years would reveal if there's a pattern of favoritism.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, that's a start. I'm more interested in the complaint logs. It's better to know what makes people angry before we make a mistake.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Exactly! If the job is too hard, it'll just be ignored again. I want to see the handover files and the minutes to see what failed!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I will focus on the morning departures and the rain exposure. If we understand the flow and the damage, we can allocate spaces more logically.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'll stick to the financial records. It's the only way to ensure the system is sustainable and that no one is being overcharged.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will look into the sticker register and the association minutes. I want to see if the current distribution is based on any actual rule.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take the complaint log and the minutes as well. I'd rather avoid a scenario where neighbors stop speaking to each other in the lobby.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll check the treasurer's handover file and the minutes too! I need to know if the paperwork is a nightmare or a breeze!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
